                        "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                        "entry_id": "0001e1eb-ee07-3959-9909-87c426871f57",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to congratulation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c62ef774-1558-47c6-9a9b-f18086c75d48",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "A while back on this page we made a congratulational note to the effect that we had never in any student council election campaign heard a single candidate “smear” his opponent, a practice that is common in adult political campaigns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63d6f332-a610-4e51-9661-154c06dc8358",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "On May 8, 1951, the Board of Directors adopted two resolutions which were congratulational messages to the National Bureau of Standards and the British Standards Institution on their 50th anniversary."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8b56f66-10e3-445d-ada2-28b1defc542f",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "On such occasions it customary for someone like me to say a few things informational, a few things inspirational, and perhaps a few things “congratulational.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "357f6c27-a18a-4091-8ebb-82bc8220853c",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "Aside from the oh-what-a-good-boy-am-I self congratulational aspect of the statement, it is worth noting that this is being done at the age of 49, without a prior high school education and with an evaluation at the age of eleven that determined me to be borderline retarded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76e44939-245e-4855-b63f-d98eacf655b5",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "President Roh Moo-hyun, in his congratulational address on the National Independence Day, stressed upon the realization of a self-defense policy within 10 years."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5743781e-c239-4d3e-867a-45dbb8193d4a",
                                "sense_id": "b36e9aeb-a629-3cea-86d4-483e9ce311ee",
                                "text": "Applause is a bit too congratulational if you ask me... Like saying.. \"well done!! you died!!!\"... The other alternative would be to announce over the PA system and display a message of condolence..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
